{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "She's got a whole CD out, huh...": "",
  "Oh, you were listening too? Thanks, newcomer!": "",
  "(Should I buy her CD for 1500 yen...?)": "",
  "Can I get one as well?": "",
  "Sure! I'm glad you liked it that much.": "",
  "Any time you want to hear more, I'll be here singing my heart out! ...Hope to see you around!": "",
  "(Nah. Even if I bought one, I probably wouldn't listen to it anyway.)": "",
  "Hey, haven't we met before?": "",
  "The girl singing out in front of Theater Square, right?": "",
  "Yes. My name is Sana Mihama!": "",
  "You bought my CD, didn't you?": "",
  "Yeah. I'm surprised you remember me.": "",
  "Of course I do. You might not realize it, but buying my CD\nis like sowing a seed of hope for my career.": "",
  "Mind telling me your name, stranger?": "",
  "I'm Yagami. I work as a detective around here.": "",
  "Wow, you're actually a detective!? I've only seen those in\nthe movies.": "",
  "The girl from the cabaret club, right?": "",
  "Yeah, your name was... Umm... Yasuko-chan?": "",
  "(Ooh. I guess not.)": "",
  "Um. Who's Yasuko?": "",
  "Ah... that was just a joke. Don't worry about it.": "",
  "Yeah. No, I totally remember. You were...": "",
  "That saleslady, right? I told you, I'm not interested.": "",
  "<font_kind=yakuza_italic>Saleslady</font_kind>!? Th-That's not right at all!": "",
  "Then are you trying to get me to join a cult? I'll tell you\nstraight up, I'm not the type. Plus I'm broke.": "",
  "Why would you even <font_kind=yakuza_italic>think</font_kind> that?": "",
  "Now I see what it is. They're using cute girls like you to\nlure out sad, lonely guys like me... Er...": "",
  "...You want me to break my guitar over your head?": "",
  "...Was I wrong?": "",
  "Geez! You completely forgot me, didn't you?": "",
  "Sorry, I'll stop messing around... I do that sometimes.\nYou were...": "",
  "So... you listened to my song. Did... you like it?": "",
  "And you know what, I got really into it. Especially the\nlyrics.": "",
  "Aww, thank you! Hearing that kind of thing makes my day.": "",
  "I am a singer-songwriter, after all.": "",
  "Being able to do both is pretty impressive.": "",
  "There's just something about your music... I can't quite put\nmy finger on it, but the way you sing is incredible.": "",
  "Yeah. Pulled me in right from the start.": "",
  "Wow... That means a lot to me, Yagami-san.": "",
  "I actually haven't listened to it the whole way through, so\nmy opinion might not count for much. Sorry...": "",
  "Gotcha... Well, at least you're honest.": "",
  "All things considered, I still have a long road ahead of\nme...": "",
  "By the way, you're not here to drink, are you? Not to presume, but you look a little young.": "",
  "Oh, no, I'm just here to sing! And yes, I've got another year before I can drink.": "",
  "Basically what happened was, the owner listened to a couple\nof my songs and ended up asking if I could perform.": "",
  "Guess he really likes your music. That's always good news.": "",
  "...Hey, would you mind singing something for me?": "",
  "Not at all! In fact, I'd love to!": "",
  "Um, Yagami-san? I'm glad I got to talk with you today.": "",
  "I'll still be doing my street gig, so stop by during the day\nif you ever wanna hear more.": "",
  "Hi, Yagami-san!": "",
  "Hey, Sana-chan. What's happening?": "",
  "Okay, so get this!": "",
  "Someone from a production company came up to me and\nactually introduced himself!": "",
  "No kidding... And he was a producer?": "",
  "I think so. Why else would he come up to me after he heard\nme sing?": "",
  "\"Our agency will do whatever it takes to help you become a\nstar,\" is what he told me.": "",
  "That's great!": "",
  "Crazy, right? I get chills just thinking about it.\nI mean, me, up there on the stage, as a professional...": "",
  "With talent like yours, I'm sure you'll be fine.": "",
  "Yeah! You can do it, Sana-chan!": "",
  "Your songs have the power to reach people in ways they've\nnever been reached before! I would know...": "",
  "With your kind of talent, you'll be a superstar in no time!": "",
  "Everyone...": "",
  "Finally, your big break! Feels like you're already on\nanother level than us...": "",
  "Aren't you getting just a <font_kind=yakuza_italic>little bit</font_kind> ahead of yourself?": "",
  "Haha, maybe so.": "",
  "Oh... Yagami-san...": "",
  "Hey there. How'd it go with that agency?": "",
  "You're so quiet. Is something wrong?": "",
  "No, it's nothing. I must look pretty down, huh?": "",
  "Ah, Sana-san! I knew I'd find you sooner or later!": "",
  "Heard you do a little performance here at night. And I must\nsay, you don't disappoint!": "",
  "But why waste your talent on all these thankless small-time\nshows when you could step into the spotlight right now?": "",
  "I wouldn't say they're <font_kind=yakuza_italic>thankless</font_kind>...": "",
  "Come on. Look around you. You could be doing this in front\nof millions of people. All you have to do is sign with me.": "",
  "Hey, cheer up. This is a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.\nBesides, you won't get any fans with <font_kind=yakuza_italic>that</font_kind> gloomy face.": "",
  "(Is this guy... the producer she was talking about?)": "",
  "And who might you be?": "",
  "Oh, I'm... just an acquaintance.": "",
  "Hmm. An acquaintance, you say? You sure don't look like any\nordinary guy to me. What line of work are you in?": "",
  "I'm a detective. The name's Yagami.": "",
  "Well aren't you fancy... Here, why don't you take my card?": "",
  "I may need to ask you for your expertise sometime. Heh.": "",
  "...Then I'll be waiting for your call.": "",
  "All right, Sana-chan. My offer's still on the table, so.\nThink about it.": "",
  "Was that the producer you mentioned last time?": "",
  "...Yes. His name is Saito-san.": "",
  "(She's really not her usual self today...)": "",
  "Hey, did something happen with him? Is he bothering you?": "",
  "I don't even know how to say it.": "",
  "No... that's not it...": "",
  "(Hmm, it seems like something else is on her mind...)": "",
  "(Hope I'm not overthinking it.)": "",
  "(Yeah, something's definitely up.)": "",
  "He asked me to do a certain job...": "",
  "As a condition for my professional debut.": "",
  "And... what kind of job would that be?": "",
  "He wants me to entertain the CEO of a company his agency\nworks with.": "",
  "Entertain? Like have dinner with him?": "",
  "If it was only that, then it wouldn't be too bad.": "",
  "But he told me to prepare for what happens <font_kind=yakuza_italic>after</font_kind> dinner.": "",
  "Meaning... he wants you to sleep with him?": "",
  "...I'm not sure. He didn't give me a clear answer when I\nasked him.": "",
  "I could just be imagining things.": "",
  "Either way, it doesn't sound like something you can casually\nagree to.": "",
  "Right. Now, Yagami-san... You did say you were a detective,\ndidn't you?": "",
  "That I did.": "",
  "So, I've actually heard some bad rumors about this producer\nfrom my friend who's also trying to be a singer.": "",
  "She said that girls who get involved with this guy end up\nexperiencing horrible things...": "",
  "That's... a rumor you probably shouldn't ignore, especially\nin your position.": "",
  "I thought as much. If the rumors turn out to be true, then\nit seems he wants us girls for more than just our voice.": "",
  "That's why I was wondering... Um...": "",
  "You want me to investigate whether you can trust him or not.": "",
  "Th-That's right.": "",
  "Will you do it, Yagami-san? I'll pay you however much you\nneed.": "",
  "I've never been one to turn down an official case, so...\nConsider me at your service.": "",
  "I truly appreciate it.": "",
  "But I gotta warn you, I'm not cheap. Can someone who barely\nmade it to the big city even afford something like this?": "",
  "W-Well... I...": "",
  "Pay me when you're successful. ": "",
  "You don't have to pay me now. But when you make it big, I'm\ngonna charge you double. So pay me when you're successful.": "",
  "Hehe. I'm not sure if you're kind or just greedy.": "",
  "Well, I am running a business, too.": "",
  "Then I'll take you up on your offer. Thanks so much,\nYagami-san!": "",
  "I look forward to seeing you shine.": "",
  "I'm sorry to put it like this, but...": "",
  "You barely moved into town, right? I doubt you have the\nbudget to hire a private investigator.": "",
  "T-That's... true...": "",
  "Then how about I pay you... in another way?": "",
  "Wait a minute, you're not actually offering to—": "",
  "Of course not! I was thinking more along the lines of...\nsinging for you?": "",
  "...I guess not, huh? My songs still aren't worth that\nmuch.": "",
  "(Great, now I made myself look like a dick. I need to turn\nthis situation around.)": "",
  "The producer's name is Saito. He's usually scouting talent\naround Theater Square.": "",
  "Careful, though. Now that he knows who you are, he might be\non guard.": "",
  "Hey, I'll think of something.": "",
  "(Saito's supposed to be hanging around Theater Square... Better head over there.)": "",
  "(But where is he? Maybe I need to look more carefully...)": "",
  "Hey there. Interested in becoming Japan's next top talent?": "",
  "Sorry, but no thanks. I'm in a hurry right now.": "",
  "Hmph. Basic bitch.": "",
  "Yes, this is Saito... Uh-huh. Yeah, about Sana-chan...": "",
  "(That's Saito all right... Now what's he saying about\nSana-chan?)": "",
  "Yep. Mhm. Correct. I talked with her not too long ago.\nShe knows the deal. Okay. Absolutely. Will do.": "",
  "I'll head over there right now.": "",
  "(Good. Lead the way, you jackass.)": "",
  "Who the hell...?": "",
  "(Looks like they're getting down to business. I need to get\nclose enough to hear them, but without getting caught.)": "",
  "Huh? Aren't you that detective I met at Tender?": "",
  "(...Shit!)": "",
  "Uh, hi.": "",
  "(I doubt they'll keep talking like this for much longer.)": "",
  "(I should get a little further away.)": "",
  "(Can't hear a thing... Is there any way I can get closer?)": "",
  "So, how 'bout her? Cute, isn't she?": "",
  "Fuck yeah she is. How old's this gal?": "",
  "Only 19. So she's right up your alley. Her name's Sana\nMihama... Says she wants to be a singer-songwriter.": "",
  "Aww, ain't that adorable.": "",
  "I know, right? She seems really pure... Bet a lot of dudes\nwould get off to that.": "",
  "Heh heh, I can already see the captions:": "",
  "\"Innocent babe bares it all on camera: Watch what she'll do for stardom!\"": "",
  "\"Sweet Sana-chan from the suburbs wants to be a singer, but\nwhen she gets caught by a perverted producer...\"": "",
  "\"He discovers her true talents lie elsewhere!\"": "",
  "Whaddya think?": "",
  "You are one disgusting motherfucker, you know that? ...And is that perverted producer supposed to be me?": "",
  "Hahaha, <font_kind=yakuza_italic>of course</font_kind> it is, dumbass! Even amateur shit's gotta sound legit these days.": "",
  "(My god... These people make me sick.)": "",
  "But yeah, as I was saying. This chick could make us hella dough. I ain't gonna just hand her over to television.": "",
  "Makes sense. Well, I already gave her the heads up, so go ahead and film her. Who knows, maybe she'll like it?": "",
  "(I... I need to report this to the client.)": "",
  "Sana-chan. I found out some things you should know... Very disturbing things. Where are you right now?": "",
  "Okay. I'm over at Theater Square.": "",
  "Good. I'll be right there, so please wait for me.": "",
  "That's strange... She should be around here somewhere.": "",
  "...Sana-chan?": "",
  "Yagami-san, help! They're forcing me to go to their office...": "",
  "Hey! Hurry it up!": "",
  "Sana-chan!": "",
  "This is bad! Where could she be!? ...Didn't she mention an office?": "",
  "(Come on... there has to be a clue somewhere!)": "",
  "Hey... What are Sana-chan's fanboys doing in a place like\nthis?": "",
  "A-All right. Sana-chan, here I come!": "",
  "We're coming to free you from your cage, O Beautiful\nSongstress of Kamurocho!": "",
  "Are you guys ready!?": "",
  "Here we go! Chaaaaaarge!!!": "",
  "Hey, what do you guys think you're doing!?": "",
  "Oh... You're the one who was talking to Sana-chan.": "",
  "Some sketchy guys ran off with her, and nothing about it\nseemed right at all! So it was up to us to follow them.": "",
  "We don't have time for this, brethren! Sana-chan's in there!": "",
  "So this is the place.": "",
  "We've got a pretty solid infiltration plan. Did you come to\njoin us?": "",
  "No... You guys wait here and call the police. I'll deal with\nthem on my own.": "",
  "O-Okay... Good luck, sir.": "",
  "What the—!? Just who do ya think y'are, barging in here\noutta nowhere!": "",
  "Yagami-san...?": "",
  "I'm here to take Sana-chan home.": "",
  "Oh, you're that detective. Would you mind not getting in our\nway?": "",
  "Yeah, all we mean to do is educate her a little. So she\nwon't misbehave on the job.": "",
  "Ya want in on the fun? Then you'll hafta settle for sloppy\nseconds. Or maybe slippery thirds.": "",
  "...Get away from her.": "",
  "Oh boy. Acting out the hero fantasy, are we?": "",
  "...Then it's time we gave ya a taste of reality!": "",
  "Are you all right, Sana-chan?": "",
  "It's all right, Sana-chan. You're safe now.": "",
  "Thank you, Yagami-san.": "",
  "I'm sorry I let this happen. If only I'd have warned you...": "",
  "No... Don't blame this on yourself.": "",
  "Do you... Do you think I'm not meant to be famous?": "",
  "What are you saying?": "",
  "What happened just now... I don't think I can take anymore. If this is what the future's like for me, then forget it.": "",
  "I'm sure there are ways to prevent this from happening again. There has to be.": "",
  "Maybe that's true... But I...": "",
  "Sana-chan...": "",
  "Just thinking about those awful men makes me cringe...\nI'm literally shaking right now.": "",
  "You went through something no one should ever have to\nexperience. It's those men who were disgusting, not you.": "",
  "Yeah, but look what happened... I'm nothing but a clueless\ncountry girl... with no idea how cruel the city really is.": "",
  "All I wanted was to be under the flashing lights, pouring\nout my soul to people who love my music...": "",
  "And what did I end up doing? I walked right into a trap, not\neven caring about the consequences.": "",
  "So ignorant... So... stupid!": "",
  "Come on, no you're not...": "",
  "You know. Maybe I should just go back to the countryside. Forget my hopeless dream...": "",
  "Don't you think it's a little too early to be giving up like\nthis?": "",
  "Yes, you trusted the wrong people. But that was your only\nfault, and it was an accident at that.": "",
  "Are you really going to give up on your dream, just because\nyou stumbled on your first step?": "",
  "I... don't know what to tell you.": "",
  "I've made some mistakes in my time, too. I know how much it\nhurts to think you've won, only to have it all taken away...": "",
  "But if you let your dream go, it'll never come back.\nNo matter how much you regret it later on.": "",
  "Hey, if you still want to give up, though, I won't stop you.": "",
  "That may actually be a good thing. You are still young,\nafter all.": "",
  "You have plenty of opportunities ahead of you, so you can\nstart over as many times as you want. At least for now.": "",
  "...Maybe you're right.": "",
  "(Would that really be best for her, though?)": "",
  "I appreciate you trying to make me feel better, Yagami-san.\nBut actually, I...": "",
  "Don't give up, Sana-chan!": "",
  "Yeah! You're a super talented singer, Sana-chan! Throwing\naway all those songs you wrote... would be a terrible waste!": "",
  "That's right! I have no idea how I'd get through my day\nwithout you!": "",
  "Everyone... But... I...": "",
  "♪ Far beyond the road of life, and deep within my dreams...": "",
  "I-I chase behind a shadow that my mind's eye cannot see... ♪": "",
  "The moments when I care the most, is when I get too close... But then the voice inside of me rings out with all my hope!": "",
  "...Hope...": "",
  "That's you, Sana-chan! You sang that in front of all of us! Remember? It isn't like you to give up hope!": "",
  "It's not like me... to give up?": "",
  "Yeah! That's because... you're the light of hope itself!": "",
  "Th-That song gave me courage to face my boring-ass job\nevery day, no matter how much it sucks!": "",
  "All because of my song...?": "",
  "Yes ma'am! Your passion sets our spirits ablaze with burning\ndesire! That's why we'll never give up on you!": "",
  "All of you... *sniffle* What would I do without you guys?": "",
  "Looks like you've already got yourself a dedicated fanbase.\nCan't ask for much more than that.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "And who might you be?": "แล้วคุณเป็นใครเหรอครับ?",
  "Whaddya think?": "คิดว่าไงล่ะ?",
  "What are you saying?": "พูดอะไรของแกน่ะ?"
 }
}
